{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20069",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.36,
      "end_seconds": 6.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "Uh, morning, doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.74,
      "end_seconds": 11.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 12.74,
      "end_seconds": 19.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "Doctor, I'll sit in if that's okay, I know what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.89,
      "end_seconds": 26.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 27.57,
      "end_seconds": 36.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.73,
      "text": "Ah, you know, it's itching around my bottom, doctor. He didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.48,
      "end_seconds": 41.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "So, when was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.86,
      "end_seconds": 47.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Erm, I've had it since last weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.15,
      "end_seconds": 60.66,
      "duration_seconds": 9.51,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.48,
      "end_seconds": 69.07,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "A eight out of ten, I suppose. It's all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.44,
      "end_seconds": 72.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.44,
      "end_seconds": 87.88,
      "duration_seconds": 13.44,
      "text": "It usually comes with bright red blood on the paper. There's a lump near my back passage as well. So, um, there's hard stools as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.6,
      "end_seconds": 101.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.97,
      "end_seconds": 116.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.96,
      "end_seconds": 137.94,
      "duration_seconds": 8.98,
      "text": "Okay: temperature is 37.0 degrees, blood pressure 118 over 71, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, pulse is 75 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.53,
      "end_seconds": 140.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.85,
      "end_seconds": 145.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.92,
      "end_seconds": 152.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Alright, I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.91,
      "end_seconds": 156.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Right, tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.23,
      "end_seconds": 174.76,
      "duration_seconds": 8.53,
      "text": "There is a small soft lump at the edge of the anus and no tear that I can see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.62,
      "end_seconds": 188.01,
      "duration_seconds": 9.39,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Let me check a few things. Any fever, dizziness, severe pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.99,
      "end_seconds": 196.4,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "I, I haven't had fever, dizziness, severe pain or weight loss, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.3,
      "end_seconds": 201.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Any black stools or change in bowel habit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.3,
      "end_seconds": 210.87,
      "duration_seconds": 7.57,
      "text": "Actually, you know, no, no black stools or change in bowel habit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.67,
      "end_seconds": 214.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.58,
      "end_seconds": 217.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.45,
      "end_seconds": 221.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.55,
      "end_seconds": 227.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Well, you know, my grandmother had dementia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.41,
      "end_seconds": 230.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.36,
      "end_seconds": 236.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.07,
      "end_seconds": 240.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.8,
      "end_seconds": 247.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.99,
      "end_seconds": 266.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 267.02,
      "end_seconds": 270.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "It's iron tablets, once a day, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.71,
      "end_seconds": 274.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.89,
      "end_seconds": 280.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Just a varicose vein procedure, last year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.25,
      "end_seconds": 285.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.45,
      "end_seconds": 291.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "I, I have low haemoglobin, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.02,
      "end_seconds": 300.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.67,
      "text": "Right, yes, low haemoglobin is known to us, good to have that clear. Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.65,
      "end_seconds": 304.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 305.86,
      "end_seconds": 313.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.03,
      "text": "Hold on, doctor, I think he reacted to erythromycin once. I'm not certain, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.21,
      "end_seconds": 319.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Ah, maybe, but I don't recall it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.52,
      "end_seconds": 327.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Fair enough, I'll write down both versions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.54,
      "end_seconds": 363.79,
      "duration_seconds": 21.25,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, it's hard to say. Haemorrhoids is one possibility and an anal tear another, and I'd rather not commit yet. So, to recap quickly. You've had itching around your bottom, since last weekend, and no weight loss or dizziness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.11,
      "end_seconds": 365.81,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.35,
      "end_seconds": 400.04,
      "duration_seconds": 32.69,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a blood count for rectal bleeding. Let's book a camera test of the bowel to look into rectal bleeding. What I'm giving you is haemorrhoid cream, twice a day, for a week. That's for haemorrhoids. Fibre, plenty of water, and don't sit on the toilet for long. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 401.1,
      "end_seconds": 408.42,
      "duration_seconds": 7.32,
      "text": "If the bleeding gets heavier or you feel faint, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 409.91,
      "end_seconds": 412.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Okay, um, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 413.11,
      "end_seconds": 417.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 418.8,
      "end_seconds": 421.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}